        rules: {
          objective: 'Take more than half the card points (55 or more of 109) in tricks; win last trick (Vanto) and other bonuses (Pigliata, 4 Re, Arie) for jochi. Soloist plays alone against the others; in 4-player, caller may name a trump to get a secret partner.',
          gameplay: 'Must follow suit. Must trump if void. Fugitive (Fool) is excuse. Trumps 20-1 (highest to lowest), plus Miseria (lowest).',
